# 换行符策略：仓库里一律存 LF，只在检出到 Windows 工作区时才转 CRLF。
# 不加这个文件的话，Git 每次都会提示 "LF will be replaced by CRLF"，
# 而且协作/换机器时会产生「什么都没改但整个文件都变了」的假 diff
# —— README §九 记过同类坑（build_site.py 用 read_bytes 就是为了避开它）。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源：绝不参与换行符转换与 diff 文本化
*.webp  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff2 binary
*.woff  binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.zip   binary

# 生成物不必在 diff 里刷屏
data/gallery.json      linguist-generated
data/palette-pool.json linguist-generated
assets/css/fonts.css   linguist-generated
